# libmpv runtime DLL — 97 MB, fetched fresh on clone via
# release-tools/fetch_mpv.ps1.  We commit the import library + headers
# (small, version-pinned) but the binary itself stays out of git so
# the repo doesn't balloon at every mpv update.
src-tauri/third-party/mpv/libmpv-2.dll
